#: scenario4:scenario4_15CB16D0_E549_433B_9F2B_A0AE54A1DD91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95a836d944dbc707cd9b896ccde831c781bacafe4f9c18154203220d09576154
