"⟪k:0⟫......te⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫......intesi?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫.........dere⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫......la⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫............bene..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_6EB564AD_94E5_468B_B345_ED2F871A2E39
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a326263f874194184fad0a78f9582cc138bfc4f09d3153279b000a02cb9f587a
#. default-sha256: 19b41728af3a3f3891ac4ec22da4d5945f160c0018f9ae33b04b4b9faf24bcf4
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6EB564AD_94E5_468B_B345_ED2F871A2E39"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He was having trouble making out what they were saying, but he could tell it was several "
"men, and they were outside the front door."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Aveva difficoltà a comprendere cosa stessero dicendo, ma poté dedurre che erano diversi "
"uomini, e si trovavano di fronte alla porta principale."

#: scenario4:scenario4_7EC4247B_E5E4_4739_B6F7_7877CE948467
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: df0ed81f6364fff9cc1d278cb35a9ab8512b0f7f7b535afb4e1d2453af7f8eb9
#. default-sha256: d5127b10d6b85e8e1c859beaa993a423f60d230cfc8331b12c801c3e199f4fca
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7EC4247B_E5E4_4739_B6F7_7877CE948467"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The fact that he could hear them at all through the heavy door meant they were probably "
"shouting quite loudly."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il fatto che riuscisse a sentirli attraverso il pesante portone voleva dire che "
"probabilmente stavano urlando abbastanza forte."

#: scenario4:scenario4_15A7E258_72FE_465C_88F0_C2CB7DEE21F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
