msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario4:scenario4_5CEEA977_CD91_4C02_B668_368F8D0B8781
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6dec67ac400ec419ff562ca3e897b2090f8121b0548d0728d091e2cbda15f6d5
#. default-sha256: bd0fb4d8f3b6ed65b7f8908e524ff8a02397c1ccc60eef223ddba3dac596d1f6
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_5CEEA977_CD91_4C02_B668_368F8D0B8781"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫An indescribable sense of uneasiness came over him. ⟪k:1⟫Dread. ⟪k:2⟫He drew nearer to the "
"door and focused on the voices on the other side."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Venne colto da un indescrivibile senso d’inquietudine. ⟪k:1⟫Di terrore.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Si avvicinò "
"alla porta e si concentrò sulle voci dall’altro lato."

#: scenario4:scenario4_94A37FCB_0D02_4E7F_831E_711A98040308
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab6408e72f6df930f9c81c547144dff8e3f8aec7bc730196df1ac5ae4c79f89d
#. default-sha256: 9b9860d12070186cf08b8df7fa782f9f5d2765f52cbbc3ae03cdcff3f174b62b
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_94A37FCB_0D02_4E7F_831E_711A98040308"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They grew clearer—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫enough for him to make out what the men were saying."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Queste si fecero sempre più chiare—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫abbastanza da permettergli di capire cosa "
"quegli uomini stessero dicendo."

#: scenario4:scenario4_DE196966_60D1_4F84_A73A_06CABADD72E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 41e794e3d07ccb4d561c73ce1a59075b74a17fa062684e65e49e3753690e9372
#. default-sha256: 1fbba9d8772321805c12febb952c958598d01043905f78dd6fb20bb140e944e6
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_DE196966_60D1_4F84_A73A_06CABADD72E2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Everything’s in place.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We’re ready to kill this witch now."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫È⟪k:2⟫ tutto in ordine.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Siamo pronti per uccidere la strega in qualunque "
"momento."

#: scenario4:scenario4_020BB8B6_BA4E_4354_A1E9_8CEC4E825D30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aab616f19f0191900cb9e9daed8cc4e6817b51ade3a3d1ce48317e4851fa2c44
#. default-sha256: c8d0b916665d502b3644449933191af07f8bcb07e5cc6cfad5bf42b6fb2b0813
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_020BB8B6_BA4E_4354_A1E9_8CEC4E825D30"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This is definitely the place.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That half-dead bandit said she was in this mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫È⟪k:2⟫ sicuramente questo il posto.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Quel bandito mezzo morto aveva detto che "
"si trovava in questa villa."

#: scenario4:scenario4_F5E94AA9_A9AA_4E9A_A20B_D8B3B8954BB6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a1280300d857181758fa835112dc64731e534def176edb72961285b1264f5cd9
#. default-sha256: 8e0110d3b7f53848a144407cf2dcc5b2edd203fa171dec7dc8bb02de134c8d02
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F5E94AA9_A9AA_4E9A_A20B_D8B3B8954BB6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Listen well. No matter what we find in there, we kill it.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It could be a child for "
"all I care—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫that doesn’t change anything."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ascoltatemi bene. Non importa cosa troveremo lì dentro,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫uccideremo tutto ciò che si "
"muove.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Può anche essere un bambino per quel che mi frega—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫non cambia nulla."

#: scenario4:scenario4_D8BD9768_36BB_40C7_BE0E_01A88DBA775F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 902424edcf3c93e40e38d93551f6c74ee495f8a891fe82e947712bbbcc69dafc
#. default-sha256: 571af4c3daec2d91f70d4f80009d7198e46bc1915853704b7a0355eaa208e048
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D8BD9768_36BB_40C7_BE0E_01A88DBA775F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Kill the witch..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫A morte la strega..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E6DBC15F_E0F2_4941_B4B3_FB7674C65739
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cdf7313a3f635ea1c91973be898c139eb28044f19924710c693150ca66c4a381
#. default-sha256: 347384029be94276b1202a46410eda5f757037a1fc5420827c9a008af438303e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E6DBC15F_E0F2_4941_B4B3_FB7674C65739"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Kill the witch! Kill the witch! Kill the witch!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫A morte la strega! A morte la strega! A morte la strega!"

#: scenario4:scenario4_2CB8A8EE_8568_44A3_ADA7_4EB7FB5ED8F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9d43e6f8e37436b9e21f5883b8ed7321fabc4621ac03395e077f4781eefe3dc
#. default-sha256: f0f04c711f011a8a9874adb15a2c6bd6b568ea1a0eb6f41a83310b961977028e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_2CB8A8EE_8568_44A3_ADA7_4EB7FB5ED8F5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫—!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫—!"

#: scenario4:scenario4_6E7CDC7B_C369_47C1_BA22_A4E17465AAA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3659cde6c91a94c46bd7626bd7a862f46cb9d0074e2b7f56e398816b6de197a0
#. default-sha256: 6b6a8baa2fb40f6edd59b3654e2250c98c0e583d9dcb4e3e5326bd7c5367c9ed
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6E7CDC7B_C369_47C1_BA22_A4E17465AAA1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What he heard beyond the door was a group of men shouting for the death of the witch."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ciò che sentì al di là della porta era un gruppo di uomini⟪k:1⟫che inneggiavano alla morte "
"della strega."

#: scenario4:scenario4_A690B82C_4F7D_4B0F_9AD2_462D3342E8CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 360f182f314433930bd29d1754c7280251207eac3ec23e4850997605532af256
#. default-sha256: 79f59023662a5237f4428fcc2bfea220323512da9e4571e8bfd2424c69df9332
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A690B82C_4F7D_4B0F_9AD2_462D3342E8CD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In that moment, Michel regretted his decision to let the bandit go free and not watch over "
"him until the moment of his demise."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫In quel momento, Michel rimpianse di aver deciso di lasciare libero⟪k:1⟫il bandito, senza "
"tenerlo d’occhio fino al suo decesso."

#: scenario4:scenario4_3245971D_8FCA_4EC9_8C19_3F353B987522
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 135e6a3cc780fdd4c686ec49772a61505189bd2eaae32ce50585995a0dc03b31
#. default-sha256: 93037594d32e948c09b84036fe2f8951ce2a5c9f128107c80cb54d4750b72e30
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3245971D_8FCA_4EC9_8C19_3F353B987522"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He must have made his way down to the village in search of help, where he revealed what he "
"had found at the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quell’uomo doveva essere tornato al villaggio in cerca di aiuto, riferendo cosa aveva "
"trovato nella villa."

#: scenario4:scenario4_F047AE0F_CCB8_4BDB_AC49_0FD8AD283747
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f76b88fef46edbb39221e652c5163bce440247235c990e9c908833b306f0f8c5
#. default-sha256: f88169b0270c8a2ce3686067fb0acfc00a487b266f9cdff442e7de8dcf71e2f7
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F047AE0F_CCB8_4BDB_AC49_0FD8AD283747"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Dammit!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Merda!"

#: scenario4:scenario4_54F65A8D_97D4_464B_8D56_5B38582F256D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3695645a249f77c8a15df4f467e75b3bbe85a68c4fe3f45f96c3d4647a7c7e9b
#. default-sha256: 868fdef3c5ebeb50881d8b4e2173ec839a9c57289c4b602c3935d72c24868159
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_54F65A8D_97D4_464B_8D56_5B38582F256D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But it was too late.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Regret would solve nothing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma era troppo tardi.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Pentirsi non sarebbe servito a nulla."

#: scenario4:scenario4_51142D17_A574_4A28_9DD0_1458CF035845
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 24cd2c46a316c82c4fad6af315dbbbc02024a88b42381792480992abded71103
#. default-sha256: e80c9696a244c6e9d1e098e3172fafdc9846b3d0b47596519000374d284c99d5
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_51142D17_A574_4A28_9DD0_1458CF035845"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He could neither stop the villagers from raiding the house, nor could he stop the White-"
"Haired Girl from dying to the effects of his curse."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non poteva né impedire agli abitanti del villaggio di irrompere nella casa, né poteva "
"frenare gli effetti della maledizione che stava uccidendo la Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi."

#: scenario4:scenario4_181FDD0D_E253_466B_A870_811424899C19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 90f1826fa1f3f4b107eba172e96acafbb832d0fc7267c07019889a58eb9701f4
#. default-sha256: fbf1c57886db839e05d6b6de194e168309c55ef8e11260fed3c84c84bcbb409d
